<p>Transition to net zero, evolving our products and operations to preserve resources and nature.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br /></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="container layout layout__theme--default"><h2>Our Targets</h2><div class="layout__wrap story-well"><div class="layout__inner"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-4 col-12"><div class="tile tile--no-hover"><!----><div aria-label="Greenhouse Gas Emissions" role="img" class="v-image v-responsive tile__image theme--light" style="width:100%;"><div class="v-image__image v-image__image--preload v-image__image--cover" style="background-image:;background-position:center center;"></div><div class="v-responsive__content"></div></div><!----><div class="tile__text tile__text--noCatLink"><!----><!----><h2 class="tile__title tile__title--"><span>Reach net-zero GHG emissions across the value chain by 2040: reduce absolute scope 1, 2, and 3 GHG emissions by 90% by 2040 from a 2021 base year.</span></h2><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="col-md-4 col-12"><div class="tile tile--no-hover"><!----><div aria-label="Circularity" role="img" class="v-image v-responsive tile__image theme--light" style="width:100%;"><div class="v-image__image v-image__image--preload v-image__image--cover" style="background-image:;background-position:center center;"></div><div class="v-responsive__content"></div></div><!----><div class="tile__text tile__text--noCatLink"><!----><!----><h2 class="tile__title tile__title--"><span>All PVH products will contribute to the circular economy throughout the product lifecycle (design, use, and end of life) by 2030.</span></h2><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="col-md-4 col-12"><div class="tile tile--no-hover"><!----><div aria-label="Environmentally-Preferred Materials" role="img" class="v-image v-responsive tile__image theme--light" style="width:100%;"><div class="v-image__image v-image__image--preload v-image__image--cover" style="background-image:;background-position:center center;"></div><div class="v-responsive__content"></div></div><!----><div class="tile__text tile__text--noCatLink"><!----><!----><h2 class="tile__title tile__title--"><span>Sustainably source 100% of PVH's cotton, viscose and wool by 2025, and 100% of polyester by 2030.</span></h2><!----><!----></div></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="container layout layout--notitle layout__theme--default"><!----><div class="layout__wrap story-well ready"><div class="layout__inner"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-4 col-12"><div class="tile tile--no-hover"><!----><div aria-label="Packaging &amp; Waste" role="img" class="v-image v-responsive tile__image theme--light" style="width:100%;"><div class="v-image__image v-image__image--preload v-image__image--cover" style="background-image:;background-position:center center;"></div><div class="v-responsive__content"></div></div><!----><div class="tile__text tile__text--noCatLink"><!----><!----><h2 class="tile__title tile__title--"><span>PACKAGING: Reduce packaging, expand reusability, and transition to recycled content to reduce Greenhouse Gas emissions and minimize waste. WASTE: All PVH offices, distribution centers, and stores will achieve zero waste by 2030. </span></h2><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="col-md-4 col-12"><div class="tile tile--no-hover"><!----><div aria-label="Water" role="img" class="v-image v-responsive tile__image theme--light" style="width:100%;"><div class="v-image__image v-image__image--preload v-image__image--cover" style="background-image:;background-position:center center;"></div><div class="v-responsive__content"></div></div><!----><div class="tile__text tile__text--noCatLink"><!----><!----><h2 class="tile__title tile__title--"><span>Establish five collective action projects in our most water-stressed sourcing communities by 2025.</span></h2><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="col-md-4 col-12"><div class="tile tile--no-hover"><!----><div aria-label="Hazardous Chemicals and Microfiber" role="img" class="v-image v-responsive tile__image theme--light" style="width:100%;"><div class="v-image__image v-image__image--preload v-image__image--cover" style="background-image:;background-position:center center;"></div><div class="v-responsive__content"></div></div><!----><div class="tile__text tile__text--noCatLink"><!----><!----><h2 class="tile__title tile__title--"><span>Water leaving our key wet processors will have zero hazardous chemicals and be filtered for harmful microfibers by 2025.</span></h2><!----><!----></div></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><footer class="footer"><div class="footer-inner"><div class="row align-center"><div class="col-12 col-sm-1 align-self-start col"><a href="/" class="router-link-active"><img src="/img/pvh-logo.svg" alt="PVH" class="footer-logo"></a></div><div class="col-12 col-sm-10 col"><div class="row footer-nav"><div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg col"><a href="/company" class="footer-nav__nav-link">Company</a><div class="footer-nav__sub-nav"><ul><li><a href="/company/leadership">Leadership</a></li><li><a href="/company/we-are-pvh">We Are PVH</a></li><li><a href="/company/inclusion-diversity">Inclusion &amp; Diversity</a></li><li><a href="/company/pvh-foundation">The PVH Foundation</a></li><li><a href="/company/archives">Archives</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg col"><a href="/brands" class="footer-nav__nav-link">Brands</a><div class="footer-nav__sub-nav"><ul><li><a href="/brands/calvin-klein">Calvin Klein</a></li><li><a href="/brands/tommy-hilfiger">Tommy Hilfiger</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg col"><a href="/responsibility" class="footer-nav__nav-link router-link-active">Responsibility</a><div class="footer-nav__sub-nav"><ul><li><a href="/res